content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Acme Supplies invoice INV-70379 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $8,620.32 USD\n- **Rail:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. The vendor record (V-464) lists wire and ACH and is bank-verified. I sent the payment once, with an idempotency key, and did not use ACH. I did not touch Acme's other invoices: INV-67906 is already paid, and INV-57088 ($2,798.10) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}